<%args>
$dataset_id
$dataset_name
$is_dataset_owner => 0
$is_dataset_public => 0
</%args>

<%once>
    my $project_name = $c->get_conf('project_name');
    my $user = $c->user();
    my $user_name = $user ? $user->get_first_name() . " " . $user->get_last_name() : "";
</%once>

<div id="dataset-archive-loading" style="margin: 50px auto; text-align: center">
    <p><em>Carregando...</em></p>
</div>

<div id="dataset-archive-enabled" style="display: none">
    <table class="table table-hover">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Data de publicação</th>
                <th>Usuário</th>
                <th>Arquivos</th>
                <th>Publicado em</th>
                <th></th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="dataset-publish-status"></tbody>
    </table>

    <br /><br />

% if ( $is_dataset_owner ) {
    <button id="dataset-generate-archive" class="btn btn-primary"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-folder-open"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Gerar arquivos para arquivamento</button>
% } else {
    <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-folder-open"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Gerar arquivos para arquivamento</button>
    <p><small>Somente o proprietário do conjunto de dados pode gerar arquivos para arquivamento</small></p>
% }
</div>

<div id="dataset-archive-no-services" style="display: none; margin-top: 50px">
    <& /generic_message.mas, message=>"<p>A publicação de conjuntos de dados não está habilitada neste banco de dados.</p><p>É possível gerar arquivos para arquivamento, mas não publicá-los em um serviço externo. Entre em contato com um administrador para habilitar esse recurso.</p>" &>
</div>

<br /><br />

<&| /page/info_section.mas, id=> "publish_dataset_info", title => "Informações sobre a publicação de conjuntos de dados", collapsible=>1, collapsed=>1, hide_if_empty=>1 &>
    <p>A publicação permite que o proprietário de um conjunto de dados gere uma cópia dos dados e a publique em um serviço externo (como o FigShare), onde ela pode ser disponibilizada publicamente e receber um DOI.</p>
    <p>Etapas para publicar um conjunto de dados:</p>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Gerar arquivos para arquivamento</strong> - cria uma cópia estática dos dados do conjunto no momento em que os arquivos são gerados</li>
        <li><strong>Enviar os arquivos para um serviço externo</strong> - envia os arquivos para um conjunto de dados novo ou existente no serviço externo</li>
        <li><strong>Publicar o conjunto de dados externo</strong> - disponibiliza publicamente o conjunto de dados externo</li>
        <li><strong>Reservar um DOI</strong> - gera um identificador de objeto digital (DOI) para o conjunto de dados externo, que pode ser usado como referência em publicações.</li>
    </ol>
    <hr />
    <p>Observações importantes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Após a publicação do conjunto de dados externo, os arquivos enviados e os metadados ficam <em>disponíveis permanentemente</em>. Qualquer alteração precisará ser publicada em uma nova versão do conjunto de dados externo.</li>
    </ul> 
</&>

<!-- Gerar arquivos para arquivamento Dialog -->
<div class="modal fade" id="dataset-archive-generate-dialog" name="dataset-archive-generate-dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" data-backdrop="static" data-keyboard="false">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
          <h4 class="modal-title">Gerando arquivos para arquivamento</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid" id="dataset-archive-generate-dialog-content">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button id="dataset-archive-generate-dialog-close" type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Upload Files Dialog -->
<div class="modal modal-md fade" id="dataset-archive-upload-dialog" name="dataset-archive-upload-dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="datasetArchiveUploadDialog" data-backdrop="static" data-keyboard="false">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content ui-front">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="datasetArchiveUploadDialog">Enviar conjunto de dados</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="warning-alert">
                <span class="warning-alert-icon glyphicon glyphicon-exclamation-sign"></span>
                <div>
                    <p><strong>IMPORTANTE!</strong> Ao continuar o envio destes arquivos, você declara que estes dados podem ser compartilhados no <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name">o serviço externo</span> e disponibilizados publicamente (assim que o conjunto de dados no <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name">o serviço externo</span> for publicado).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <ol id="dataset-archive-publish-instructions">
                <li>
                    <p>Selecione o serviço externo para o qual deseja enviar este conjunto de dados:</p>
                    <select id="dataset-archive-publish-services" class="form-control"></select>
                </li>
                <li class="dataset-archive-publish-connect">
                    <p>Verifique se você tem uma conta e está conectado a <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
                    <a id="dataset-archive-publish-account" class="btn btn-info btn-sm" href="#" target="_blank">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-user"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Visualizar sua conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li class="dataset-archive-publish-connect">
                    <p>Autorize <% $project_name %> a acessar sua conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
                    <button class="dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-small"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Conectar contas
                    </button>
                </li>
                <li class="dataset-archive-publish-connected">
                    <p>Você está conectado a esta conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span>:</p>
                    <p><strong>Nome:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-name"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-email"></span></p>
                    <button class="dataset-archive-publish-disconnect-btn btn btn-danger btn-sm">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-full"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Desconectar contas
                    </button>
                </li>
                <li class="dataset-archive-publish-connected">
                    <p>Selecione um conjunto de dados em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span> para associar a estes dados:</p>
                    <select id="dataset-archive-publish-articles" class="form-control">
                        <option value="">Criar um conjunto de dados em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></option>
                    </select>
                    <hr />
                    <label>Título:</label>
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <span id="dataset-archive-publish-article-title-addon" class="input-group-addon"></span>
                        <input id="dataset-archive-publish-article-title" class="form-control dataset-archive-publish-article-details" />
                    </div>
                    <br />
                    <label>Descrição:</label>
                    <textarea id="dataset-archive-publish-article-description" class="form-control dataset-archive-publish-article-details"></textarea>
                    <br />
                    <label>Autores adicionais (um por linha):</label>
                    <textarea id="dataset-archive-publish-article-authors" class="form-control dataset-archive-publish-article-details" placeholder="Você será adicionado automaticamente como autor"></textarea>
                    <br />
                    <p><em>Os metadados do conjunto de dados podem ser atualizados posteriormente em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name dataset-archive-publish-article-details"></span> até que o conjunto de dados em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span> seja publicado e disponibilizado publicamente.</em></p>
                </li>
                <li class="dataset-archive-publish-connected">
                    <p>Envie e anexe os arquivos ao conjunto de dados selecionado em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span>.</p>
                    <button id="dataset-archive-publish-send" class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                        <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-export"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span id="dataset-archive-publish-send-label">Enviar arquivos</span>
                    </button>
                    <br /><br />
                    <div class="progress">
                        <div id="dataset-archive-publish-send-pb" class="progress-bar progress-bar-striped" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%;">
                            <span class="sr-only">60% concluído</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress">
                        <div id="dataset-archive-publish-send-subpb" class="progress-bar progress-bar-info" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%;">
                            <span class="sr-only">60% concluído</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px">
                        <p id="dataset-archive-publish-send-status"></p>
                        <p id="dataset-archive-publish-send-substatus" style="font-size: 95%; font-style: italic"></p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Publicar conjunto de dados Dialog -->
<div class="modal modal-md fade" id="dataset-archive-publish-dialog" name="dataset-archive-publish-dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="datasetArchivePublishDialog" data-backdrop="static" data-keyboard="false">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-md" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content ui-front">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="datasetArchivePublishDialog">Publicar conjunto de dados</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="warning-alert">
                <span class="warning-alert-icon glyphicon glyphicon-exclamation-sign"></span>
                <div>
                    <p><strong>IMPORTANTE!</strong> Ao tornar público o conjunto de dados externo, todos os arquivos enviados e metadados ficam <em>disponíveis permanentemente</em> e não podem ser removidos nem modificados nessa versão. Para atualizar os dados, será necessário enviar os novos arquivos e publicar uma nova versão do conjunto de dados externo (a versão original continuará acessível).</p>
                    <p><strong><em>Verifique se tudo está correto antes de publicar!</em></strong></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr />

            <div class="dataset-archive-publish-connect">
                <p>Autorize <% $project_name %> a acessar sua conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
                <button class="dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-small"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Conectar contas
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="dataset-archive-publish-connected">
                <p>Você está conectado a esta conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span>:</p>
                <p><strong>Nome:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-name"></span></p>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-email"></span></p>
                <button class="dataset-archive-publish-disconnect-btn btn btn-danger btn-sm">
                    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-full"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Desconectar contas
                </button>
            </div>

            <hr />

            <p><strong>Serviço:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Título:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-publish-title"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Autores:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-publish-authors"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Descrição:</strong><br /><span id="dataset-archive-publish-description"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Arquivos:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-publish-files"></span></p>
            <p><a id="dataset-archive-publish-link" href="#" target="_blank">Visualizar detalhes em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></a></p>

            <hr />

            <button id="dataset-archive-publish-public" class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-share"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span id="dataset-archive-publish-send-label">Publicar e disponibilizar publicamente</span>
            </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Reservar DOI Dialog -->
<div class="modal modal-md fade" id="dataset-archive-doi-dialog" name="dataset-archive-doi-dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="datasetArchiveDOIDialog" data-backdrop="static" data-keyboard="false">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-md" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content ui-front">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="datasetArchiveDOIDialog">Reservar um DOI</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div id="dataset-archive-doi-private-warning" class="warning-alert">
                <span class="warning-alert-icon glyphicon glyphicon-exclamation-sign"></span>
                <div>
                    <p>Este conjunto de dados em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span> ainda é privado. O DOI gerado será ativado quando o conjunto de dados for publicado e disponibilizado publicamente.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr />

            <div class="dataset-archive-publish-connect">
                <p>Autorize <% $project_name %> a acessar sua conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
                <button class="dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-small"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Conectar contas
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="dataset-archive-publish-connected">
                <p>Você está conectado a esta conta em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span>:</p>
                <p><strong>Nome:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-name"></span></p>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-email"></span></p>
                <button class="dataset-archive-publish-disconnect-btn btn btn-danger btn-sm">
                    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-resize-full"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Desconectar contas
                </button>
            </div>

            <hr />

            <p><strong>Serviço:</strong> <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Título:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-doi-title"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Autores:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-doi-authors"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Descrição:</strong><br /><span id="dataset-archive-doi-description"></span></p>
            <p><strong>Arquivos:</strong> <span id="dataset-archive-doi-files"></span></p>
            <p><a id="dataset-archive-doi-link" href="#" target="_blank">Visualizar detalhes em <span class="dataset-archive-publish-service-name"></span></a></p>

            <hr />

            <button id="dataset-archive-publish-doi" class="dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-barcode"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span id="dataset-archive-publish-send-label">Gerar um DOI</span>
            </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
var ISSUES = {};             // Status information about individual published issues of the dataset
var SELECTED_ISSUE;          // The currently selected published issue
var SERVICES = {};           // Information about available external services
var SELECTED_SERVICE = {};   // The currently selected external service
var SELECTED_ACCOUNT = {};   // Information on the currently selected account

jQuery(document).ready(() => {
    jQuery("#dataset-generate-archive").click(initArchive)
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-services").on("change", () => onServiceChanged());
    jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn").click(connectService);
    jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-disconnect-btn").click(disconnectService);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send").click(sendArchive);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-public").click(makePublic);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-doi").click(getDOI);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-articles").on("change", onArticleChanged);

    updateServices().then(updateIssues);
});


/**
 * Get the available external services from the server config
 * - Call displayServices() on success
 */
function updateServices() {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: '/ajax/dataset/publish/services',
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    alert(resp.error);
                }
                else {
                    displayServices(resp);
                    resolve(resp);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                alert("Não foi possível obter os serviços externos");
            }
        });
    })
}

/**
 * Display o serviço externos as options in the select menu
 */
function displayServices(services = {}) {
    SERVICES = services;

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-loading").hide();
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-enabled").show();

    if ( Object.keys(SERVICES).length > 0 ) {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-no-services").hide();
    }
    else {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-no-services").show();
    }

    var html = "";
    Object.keys(SERVICES).sort().forEach((key) => {
        html += `<option value='${key}'>${SERVICES[key].display_name} [${SERVICES[key].web_url}]</option>`;
    });
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-services").html(html);
    onServiceChanged();
}

/**
 * Handle a service change
 * - display selected service name throughout the dialog
 * - update the link for the user to check their account
 * - call updateConnection() to check for already-provided user account on the service
 */
function onServiceChanged(service) {
    SELECTED_SERVICE = SERVICES[service || jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-services").val()];
    if ( SELECTED_SERVICE ) {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-service-name").html(SELECTED_SERVICE.display_name);
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-account").attr('href', `${SELECTED_SERVICE.web_url}${SELECTED_SERVICE.user_path}`);
    }
    updateConnection();
}

/**
 * Check the User Prefs on the server to see if the user has an account with the selected service
 * - Call displayConnection()
 */
function updateConnection() {
    if ( SELECTED_SERVICE && SELECTED_SERVICE.key ) {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/connection/${SELECTED_SERVICE.key}`,
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    alert("Não foi possível atualizar as informações da conexão [" + resp.error + "]");
                    displayConnection();
                }
                else {
                    displayConnection(resp);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                alert("Não foi possível atualizar as informações da conexão");
                displayConnection();
            }
        });
    }
    else {
        displayConnection();
    }
}

/**
 * Display the user's stored account with the selected service
 * - check if provided token is still valid
 * - toggle connection / connect steps depending on account status and selected service
 */
function displayConnection(account = {}) {
    SELECTED_ACCOUNT = account;

    // A service and account have been selected
    if ( !!SELECTED_SERVICE && SELECTED_ACCOUNT.hasOwnProperty('token') && SELECTED_ACCOUNT.hasOwnProperty('profile') ) {
        const now = new Date().getTime();
        if ( SELECTED_ACCOUNT.token.expiration > now ) {
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected").show();
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect").hide();
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-name").html(SELECTED_ACCOUNT.profile.first_name + ' ' + SELECTED_ACCOUNT.profile.last_name);
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-email").html(SELECTED_ACCOUNT.profile.email);
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", false);
            updateArticles();
            return;
        }
    }

    // Only a service has been selected
    else if ( !!SELECTED_SERVICE ) {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected").hide();
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect").show();
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", true);
    }

    // Service not selected
    else {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected").hide();
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect").hide();
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", true);
    }
}

/**
 * Start the OAuth flow to allow the user to connect their account on the selected service
 * - launches a pop-up window to grant access to the user's account
 * - the pop-up will store the user's info in the User Prefs on the server
 * - once the pop-up is closed, call updateConnection() to reflect changes
 */
function connectService() {
    if ( SELECTED_SERVICE ) {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn").attr("disabled", true);
        window.authorize_data = { service: SELECTED_SERVICE };
        const popup = window.open(`/dataset/publish/authorize/${SELECTED_SERVICE.key}`, '_authorize', 
            `toolbar=no,
            location=no,
            status=no,
            menubar=no,
            scrollbars=yes,
            resizable=yes,
            width=700, 
            height=700`
        );

        if ( !popup ) {
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn").attr("disabled", false);
            alert("Permita janelas pop-up no navegador para continuar");
        }

        const interval = setInterval(() => {
            if (popup.closed) {
                clearInterval(interval);
                jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connect-btn").attr("disabled", false);
                window.authorize_data = {};
                updateConnection();
            }
        }, 500);
    }
}

/**
 * Remove the selected account from the User Prefs
 * - call updateConnection() to reflect the changes
 */
function disconnectService() {
    SELECTED_ACCOUNT = {};
    jQuery.ajax({
        url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/connection/remove/${SELECTED_SERVICE.key}`,
        method: 'DELETE',
        success: () => {
            updateConnection();
        }
    });
}

/**
 * Get a list of the user's account articles
 * - Call displayArticles() with the results
 */
function updateArticles() {
    jQuery.ajax({
        url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/articles/${SELECTED_SERVICE.key}`,
        success: (resp) => {
            if ( resp?.error ) {
                alert(resp.error)
            }
            else {
                displayArticles(resp?.articles);
            }
        },
        error: () => {
            alert("Não foi possível obter os registros da conta");
        }
    });
}

/**
 * Display the user's account articles in the article select menu
 * @param articles = Array of article metadata
 */
function displayArticles(articles = []) {
    var html = `<option value="">Criar um conjunto de dados em ${SELECTED_SERVICE.display_name}</option>`;
    articles.forEach((a) => {
        html += `<option value='${a.id}'>${a.title}</a>`;
    });
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-articles").html(html);
    onArticleChanged();
}

/**
 * Handle a changed article
 * - If a specific article is selected, fetch and display its details
 * - If a new article is selected, clear the form
 */
async function onArticleChanged() {
    var selected = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-articles").val();
    if ( selected && selected !== '' ) {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", true);
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-article-details").attr("disabled", true);
        try {
            const details = await getArticleDetails(SELECTED_SERVICE.key, selected);
            jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title").val(details.title);
            jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title-addon").html(details.status.toUpperCase());
            jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-description").val(details.description);
            jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-authors").val(details.authors.map((e) => e.full_name).join('\n'));
            jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-label").html("Adicionar arquivos ao conjunto de dados selecionado");
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", false);
        }
        catch (err) {
            alert(err);
        }
    }
    else {
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", false);
        jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-article-details").attr("disabled", false);
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title").val("");
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title-addon").html("NOVO");
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-description").val("");
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-authors").val("");
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-label").html("Criar conjunto de dados e adicionar arquivos");
    }
}

/**
 * Get the details of the specified article from o serviço externo
 * @param service = key of o serviço externo where the article is hosted
 * @param article_id = id of the specific article
 */
function getArticleDetails(service, article_id) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/articles/${service}/${article_id}`,
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    reject(`Could not get article details [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else if ( resp?.article ) {
                    resolve(resp.article);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject("Não foi possível obter os detalhes do registro externo");
            }
        });
    })
}

/**
 * Get the stored published metadata for this dataset
 * - Call displayIssues() with the results
 */
function updateIssues() {
    jQuery.ajax({
        url: '/ajax/dataset/publish/issues/<% $dataset_id %>',
        success: (resp) => {
            if ( resp?.error ) {
                alert(`Não foi possível obter as versões publicadas do conjunto de dados [${resp.error}]`);
            }
            else {
                displayIssues(resp?.published);
            }
        },
        error: () => {
            alert("Não foi possível obter as versões publicadas do conjunto de dados");
        }
    });
}

/**
 * Display the stored published metadata
 * @param issues = Object of issue metadata, where the key is the issue key
 */
async function displayIssues(issues = {}) {
    ISSUES = issues;
    const keys = Object.keys(ISSUES);
    const rows = [];
    if ( keys.length > 0 ) {
        for ( const k of keys ) {
            const s = ISSUES[k];
            const types = Object.keys(s.data || {});
            let overallSubmitted = false;
            let overallComplete = true;

            // Publish date
            var html = `<td>${new Date(s.ts).toLocaleString()}</td>`;

            // Publish User
            html += `<td><a href='/solpeople/personal-info.pl?sp_person_id=${s.user.id}'>${s.user.name}</a></td>`;

            // File List
            html += `<td><ul style='padding-left: 15px'>`;
            for ( const t of types ) {
                const file = s.data[t].file
                if ( file ) {
                    const url = `/ajax/dataset/publish/file/<% $dataset_id %>/${k}/${t}`;

                    // Check the status of each file, to see if it's been uploaded
                    let isSubmitted = s.data[t].submitted?.file_id;
                    let isComplete = s.data[t].complete === 1;

                    // Display the file name, link to download, and check if completely uploaded
                    html += `<li>`;
                    html += `<a href='${url}' target='_blank'>${file}</a>`;
                    if ( isSubmitted && isComplete ) html += `&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='glyphicon glyphicon-ok text-success'></span>`;
                    html += `</li>`;

                    if ( isSubmitted ) overallSubmitted = true;
                    if ( !isComplete ) overallComplete = false;
                }
            };
            html += `</ul></td>`;

            // Display external reference, if published
            if ( s.article?.id ) {
                html += `<td><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px">`;

                // Display Service Name
                if ( SERVICES.hasOwnProperty(s.service) ) {
                    html += `<span><strong>${SERVICES[s.service].display_name}</strong></span>`;
                }

                // Display Public Link
                if ( s.article.is_public ) {
                    html += `<div><span class="label label-primary">Público</span>&nbsp;<a href='${s.article.url_public_html}' target='_blank'>${s.article.title}</a></div>`;
                }

                // Display Private Link, only to the dataset owner
% if ( $is_dataset_owner ) {
                    html += `<div><span class="label label-info">Prévia</span>&nbsp;<a href='${s.article.url_private_html}' target='_blank'>${s.article.title}</a></div>`;
% } else {
                    if ( !s.article.is_public ) html += `<em>Publicado em um conjunto de dados privado</em>`;
% }

                // Display DOI, if available
                if ( s.article.doi && s.article.doi !== '' ) html += `<div><a href='https://doi.org/${s.article.doi}' target='_blank'>${s.article.doi}</a></div>`;
                html += `</div></td>`;
            }
            else {
                html += `<td><em>Não enviado</em></td>`;
            }

            // Display actions only to owner
% if ( $is_dataset_owner ) {
            html += `<td><div style='display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px;'>`
            if ( Object.keys(SERVICES).length > 0 ) {
                if ( !overallSubmitted || !overallComplete ) html += `<button class='btn btn-primary btn-xs' onclick='uploadIssue(${s.key})'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-export'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Enviar</button>`;
                if ( overallSubmitted && overallComplete ) html += `<button class='btn btn-primary btn-xs' onclick='editIssue(${s.key}, "${s.service}")'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-pencil'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Editar em ${SERVICES[s.service]?.display_name}</button>`;
                if ( overallSubmitted && overallComplete && s.published !== 1 ) html += `<button class='btn btn-warning btn-xs' onclick='publishIssue(${s.key}, "${s.service}")'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-share'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Publicar</button>`;
                if ( s.article?.id && (!s.article?.doi || s.article?.doi === '') ) html += `<button class='btn btn-primary btn-xs' onclick='reserveDOI(${s.key}, "${s.service}")'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-barcode'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Reservar DOI</button>`;
            }
            html += `<button class='btn btn-danger btn-xs' onclick='removeIssue(${s.key})'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-trash'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Remover</button>`;
            html += `</div></td>`;
% } else {
            html += `<td></td>`;
% }
            rows.push(html);
        }

        jQuery("#dataset-publish-status").html(`<tr>${rows.join('</tr><tr>')}</tr>`);
    }
    else {
        const html = "<tr><td colspan=5><p style='text-align: center'><em>Este conjunto de dados não foi publicado</em></p><br /><p style='text-align: center'>Para publicar este conjunto de dados, primeiro gere os arquivos para arquivamento.</p></td></tr>";
        jQuery("#dataset-publish-status").html(html);
    }
}

/**
 * Gerar arquivos para arquivamento that are stored on breedbase
 * - Initialize a new issue for this dataset, which calculates which files need to be generated
 * - After initialization, display the generate dialog and start to generate each file
 */
function initArchive() {
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-content").html("<p>Analisando conjunto de dados...</p>");
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-generate-dialog").modal("show");
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-close").attr("disabled", true);
    jQuery.ajax({
        url: '/ajax/dataset/publish/init/<% $dataset_id %>',
        success: (resp = {}) => {
            if ( resp?.error ) {
                alert(`Não foi possível iniciar o arquivamento do conjunto de dados [${resp.error}]`);
            }
            else {
                const { key, data } = resp;
                displayArchiveFiles(key, data);
            }
        },
        error: () => {
            alert(`Não foi possível iniciar o arquivamento do conjunto de dados`);
        }
    });
}

/**
 * Display the table of archive files to generate in the modal dialog
 * @param key = the key for the specific issue being generated
 * @param data = Object of archive file info (where the key is the file type and the value is the IDs of the items in the file type)
 * - This will display the generate files modal with the table of file types
 * - This will call generateArchiveFile() in sequence for each file type
 */
async function displayArchiveFiles(key, data = {}) {
    const types = Object.keys(data).sort();

    // Display the file type table
    let html = `<p>Arquivos a gerar:</p>`;
    html += `<table class='table table-striped'>`;
    html += `<thead><tr><th>Tipo de dado</th><th>Quantidade de itens</th><th>Situação</th></tr></thead>`;
    for (const t of types ) {
        const ids = data[t];
        if ( ids && ids.length > 0 ) {
            html += `<tr><td>${t}</td><td>${ids.length}</td><td id='dataset-archive-generate-dialog-status-${t}'><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-option-horizontal'></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<em>Pendente...</em></td></tr>`;
        }
    }
    html += `</table>`
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-content").html(html);

    // Generate each file type
    for ( const t of types ) {
        try {
            const ids = data[t];
            if ( ids && ids.length > 0 ) {
                const file = await generateArchiveFile(key, t);
                if ( file && file !== '' ) {
                    jQuery(`#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-status-${t}`).html(`<strong><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-ok text-success'></span></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Arquivo de arquivamento criado: ${file}`);
                }
                else {
                    jQuery(`#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-status-${t}`).html(`<strong><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-exclamation-sign text-danger'></span></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Não foi possível gerar o arquivo`);
                }
            }
        }
        catch (err) {
            jQuery(`#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-status-${t}`).html(`<strong><span class='glyphicon glyphicon-exclamation-sign text-danger'></span></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;${err}`);
        }
    }

    // Refresh the Issues
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-generate-dialog-close").attr("disabled", false);
    updateIssues();
}

/**
 * Generate an archived file for a specific data type
 * @param key = the issue key
 * @param type = the data type
 */
function generateArchiveFile(key, type) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: '/ajax/dataset/publish/generate',
            method: 'POST',
            data: {
                dataset_id: <% $dataset_id %>,
                key,
                type
            },
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    reject(`Could not generate ${type} file [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    resolve(resp.file);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject(`Could not generate ${type} file`);
            }
        });
    })
}


/**
 * Show the upload dialog for the specific issue
 */
function uploadIssue(key) {
    SELECTED_ISSUE = ISSUES[key];
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-upload-dialog").modal("show");
}

/**
 * Open the Article edit page on o serviço externo
 */
function editIssue(key, service) {
    SELECTED_ISSUE = ISSUES[key];
    onServiceChanged(service);
    if ( SELECTED_ISSUE.article && SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id ) {
        window.open(`${SELECTED_SERVICE.web_url}/account/items/${SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id}/edit`, "_blank");
    }
}

/**
 * Show the publish dialog for the specific issue (on the set external service)
 */
function publishIssue(key, service) {
    SELECTED_ISSUE = ISSUES[key];
    onServiceChanged(service);
    if ( !SELECTED_ISSUE.article || !SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id ) {
        alert("O arquivo do conjunto de dados selecionado não está associado a um registro externo!");
        return;
    }

    // Update article metadata to display
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-title").html(SELECTED_ISSUE.article.title);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-authors").html((SELECTED_ISSUE.article.authors || []).map((e) => e.full_name).join(', '));
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-description").html(SELECTED_ISSUE.article.description);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-files").html((SELECTED_ISSUE.article.files || []).map((e) => e.name).join(', '));
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-link").attr("href", SELECTED_ISSUE.article.url_private_html);

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-dialog").modal("show");
}

/**
 * Show the reserve DOI dialog for the specific issue (on the set external service)
 */
function reserveDOI(key, service) {
    SELECTED_ISSUE = ISSUES[key];
    onServiceChanged(service);
    if ( !SELECTED_ISSUE.article || !SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id ) {
        alert("O arquivo do conjunto de dados selecionado não está associado a um registro externo!");
        return;
    }

    // Update article metadata to display
    !SELECTED_ISSUE.article.is_public ? jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-private-warning").show() : jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-private-warning").hide();
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-title").html(SELECTED_ISSUE.article.title);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-authors").html((SELECTED_ISSUE.article.authors || []).map((e) => e.full_name).join(', '));
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-description").html(SELECTED_ISSUE.article.description);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-files").html((SELECTED_ISSUE.article.files || []).map((e) => e.name).join(', '));
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-link").attr("href", SELECTED_ISSUE.article.url_private_html);

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-dialog").modal("show");
}

/**
 * Remove the issue from the dataset
 * - This removes the archived files and the metadata stored with the dataset
 * - Call updateIssues() when complete to reflect changes
 */
function removeIssue(key) {
    if (confirm("Deseja realmente desvincular estes metadados publicados do conjunto de dados? Isso removerá os dados arquivados neste servidor e o vínculo entre o conjunto de dados e o serviço externo. NADA será removido do serviço externo.") ) {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/issues/remove/<% $dataset_id %>/${key}`,
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    alert(`Não foi possível remover as versões publicadas do conjunto de dados [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    updateIssues();
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                alert("Não foi possível remover as versões publicadas do conjunto de dados");
            }
        });
    }
}

/**
 * Submit the archived files to a new or existing dataset on o serviço externo
 * - This will call createArticle() to create a new article on the service, if needed
 * - Submit each of the dataset's archived files, using submitFile() to the specified article
 * - Upload each of the chunks for each file
 * - Finalize the file
 * - Update the Issues when complete to reflect the changes
 */
async function sendArchive() {
    if ( confirm(`Deseja realmente enviar os arquivos para ${SELECTED_SERVICE.display_name} agora?`) ) {
        try {
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", true);
            let article_id = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-articles").val();
            const types = [];
            for ( const t of Object.keys(SELECTED_ISSUE.data || {}) ) {
                if ( SELECTED_ISSUE.data[t].file ) {
                    types.push(t);
                }
            }

            let total = !article_id || article_id === '' ? types.length+1 : types.length;
            let count = 0;

            // Create article first, if necessary
            if ( !article_id || article_id === '' ) {
                const title = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title").val();
                progress({ msg: `Criando conjunto de dados: ${title}`, count, total });
                article_id = await createArticle();
                count ++;
            }

            // Submit each of the file types
            for (const t of types) {
                let subTotal = 1;
                let subCount = 0;

                // Submit the file
                progress({ msg: `Enviando tipo de dado: ${t}`, count, total });
                subProgress({ clear: true });
                const { parts = {}, file_id, upload_url } = await submitFile(article_id, t);
                subTotal = Object.keys(parts).length;
                subCount++;

                // Upload each part of the file
                const partNos = Object.keys(parts);
                for ( const partNo of partNos ) {
                    const part = parts[partNo];
                    subProgress({ msg: `Enviando parte: ${subCount}/${subTotal}`, count: subCount, total: subTotal+1 });
                    await submitPart(t, upload_url, part);
                    subCount++;
                };

                // Finalize the File
                subProgress({ msg: `Finalizando arquivo`, count: subCount, total: subTotal });
                await finalizeFile(t, file_id, article_id);

                // Show success for file
                subCount++;
                count++;
                subProgress({ msg: '', count: subCount, total: subTotal });
                progress({ msg: `Arquivo enviado: ${t}`, count, total });
            };

            // Show completed status
            count++;
            progress({ msg: `<strong>Todos os arquivos foram enviados!</strong>`, count, total });
            subProgress({ clear: true });
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", false);
            updateIssues();
        }
        catch (err) {
            jQuery(".dataset-archive-publish-connected-btn").attr("disabled", false);
            fail(err);
        }
    }
}

/**
 * Create a new article on the exernal service
 * - This uses the user-provided title, description, and additonal authors
 * - This will resolve with the new article id, if successful
 */
function createArticle() {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        const title = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-title").val();
        const description = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-description").val();
        const authors = jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-article-authors").val();

        if ( !title || title === '' ) return reject('Informe um nome para o novo conjunto de dados');
        if ( !description || description === '' ) return reject('Please provide a description for the new dataset');

        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/articles/new`,
            method: 'POST',
            data: {
                dataset_id: <% $dataset_id %>,
                service: SELECTED_SERVICE.key,
                title,
                description,
                authors
            },
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error || !resp?.entity_id) {
                    reject(`Não foi possível criar o registro externo [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    resolve(resp.entity_id);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject("Não foi possível criar o registro externo")
            }
        });
    });
}

/**
 * Submit the specified file to the specified article
 * - This creates the file entry, but does not upload the content
 */
function submitFile(article, data_type) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/submit`,
            method: 'POST',
            data: {
                service: SELECTED_SERVICE.key,
                article_id: article,
                dataset_id: <% $dataset_id %>,
                key: SELECTED_ISSUE.key,
                type: data_type
            },
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    reject(`Não foi possível enviar o tipo de dado: ${data_type} [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    resolve(resp);
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject(`Não foi possível enviar o tipo de dado: ${data_type}`);
            }
        });
    });
}

/**
 * Upload the specified chunk of a file to the submitted file upload URL
 */
function submitPart(data_type, upload_url, part) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        if ( part.status === 'COMPLETE' ) {
            return resolve();
        }

        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/upload`,
            method: 'POST',
            data: {
                service: SELECTED_SERVICE.key,
                dataset_id: <% $dataset_id %>,
                key: SELECTED_ISSUE.key,
                type: data_type,
                partNo: part.partNo,
                startOffset: part.startOffset,
                endOffset: part.endOffset,
                uploadUrl: upload_url
            },
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    reject(`Não foi possível enviar o arquivo: ${data_type} [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    resolve();
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject(`Não foi possível enviar o arquivo: ${data_type}`);
            }
        });
    });
}

/**
 * Finalize the file upload, done after all of the parts have been uploaded
 */
function finalizeFile(data_type, file_id, article_id) {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: '/ajax/dataset/publish/finalize',
            method: 'POST',
            data: {
                service: SELECTED_SERVICE.key,
                dataset_id: <% $dataset_id %>,
                key: SELECTED_ISSUE.key,
                type: data_type,
                file_id: file_id,
                article_id: article_id
            },
            success: (resp) => {
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    reject(`Não foi possível finalizar o arquivo: ${data_type} [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    resolve();
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                reject(`Não foi possível finalizar o arquivo: ${data_type}`);
            }
        });
    });
}

/**
 * Set the article from the selected issue as public
 */
function makePublic() {
    if ( !SELECTED_ISSUE.article || !SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id ) {
        alert("O arquivo do conjunto de dados selecionado não está associado a um registro externo!");
        return;
    }

    if ( confirm("Deseja realmente publicar este conjunto de dados agora? Esta ação não pode ser desfeita.") ) {
        jQuery("#working_modal").modal("show");
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/issues/publish/<% $dataset_id %>/${SELECTED_ISSUE.key}`,
            success: (resp) => {
                jQuery("#working_modal").modal("hide");
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    alert(`Não foi possível publicar o conjunto de dados [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    updateIssues();
                    if ( confirm(`O conjunto de dados foi publicado e está disponível publicamente em ${SELECTED_SERVICE.display_name}`) ) {
                        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-dialog").modal("hide");
                    }
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                jQuery("#working_modal").modal("hide");
                alert("Não foi possível publicar o conjunto de dados");
            }
        });
    }
}

/**
 * Reservar um DOI for the specified dataset on the specified service
 */
function getDOI(key, service) {
    if ( !SELECTED_ISSUE.article || !SELECTED_ISSUE.article.id ) {
        alert("O arquivo do conjunto de dados selecionado não está associado a um registro externo!");
        return;
    }

    if ( confirm("Deseja realmente reservar um DOI agora? Se o conjunto de dados externo ainda for privado, o DOI será ativado quando ele for publicado. Após a ativação, o DOI não poderá ser desativado.") ) {
        jQuery("#working_modal").modal("show");
        jQuery.ajax({
            url: `/ajax/dataset/publish/issues/reserveDOI/<% $dataset_id %>/${SELECTED_ISSUE.key}`,
            success: (resp) => {
                jQuery("#working_modal").modal("hide");
                if ( resp?.error ) {
                    alert(`Não foi possível reservar um DOI para este conjunto de dados [${resp.error}]`);
                }
                else {
                    updateIssues();
                    if ( confirm(`Um DOI foi gerado para este conjunto de dados em ${SELECTED_SERVICE.display_name}`) ) {
                        jQuery("#dataset-archive-doi-dialog").modal("hide");
                    }
                }
            },
            error: () => {
                jQuery("#working_modal").modal("hide");
                alert("Não foi possível reservar um DOI para este conjunto de dados");
            }
        });
    }
}

/**
 * Set main progress and message
 */
function progress({ msg, count, total, clear } = {}) {
    if ( clear ) {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").css("width", `0%`);
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-status").html("");
        return;
    }

    const percent = (count/total)*100;

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('progress-bar-danger');
    if ( percent >= 100 ) {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").addClass('progress-bar-success');
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('progress-bar-info');
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('active');
    }
    else {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('progress-bar-success');
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").addClass('progress-bar-info');
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").addClass('active');
    }

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").css("width", `${percent}%`);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-status").html(msg);
}

/**
 * Set error message
 */
function fail(msg) {
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('active');
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('progress-bar-success');
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").removeClass('progress-bar-info');
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").addClass('progress-bar-danger');
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-pb").css("width", `100%`);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-status").html(`<strong>(Falha no envio) ${msg}</strong>`);
}

/**
 * Set secondary progress and message
 */
function subProgress({ msg, count, total, clear } = {}) {
    if ( clear ) {
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-subpb").css("width", `0%`);
        jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-substatus").html("");
        return;
    }

    const percent = (count/total)*100;

    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-subpb").css("width", `${percent}%`);
    jQuery("#dataset-archive-publish-send-substatus").html(msg);
}
</script>


<style>
    #dataset-archive-publish-instructions li:not(:last-child) {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    a.btn-info {
        color: #fff !important;
    }
    a.btn-info:hover {
        color: #fff;
        background-color: #31b0d5;
    }
    .dataset-archive-publish-service-name {
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .warning-alert {
        max-width: 600px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
